OL,3,GNEWSAReform wins by-elections after
OL,4,Aoffensive comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour council seats in the West Midlands
OL,7,Fhave been defended by Reform UK after
OL,8,Fby-elections were triggered by the
OL,9,Fresignation of a councillor featured in
OL,10,Fan ITV News undercover investigation.
OL,12,FAlan Feeney, who has since stepped down
OL,13,Ffrom the party, was filmed calling
OL,14,FAsian homeowners "parasites" in the run
OL,15,Fup to council elections in May.
OL,17,FIn October, he resigned from every post
OL,18,Fhe held on Solihull Metropolitan
OL,19,FBorough Council and Birmingham City
OL,20,FCouncil, adding that his remarks "were
OL,21,Fwrong, offensive and completely
OL,22,Funacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
